        "content": "## Handle missing email\n\nLower-left validation failure path that records incomplete enquiries in Google Sheets and returns a 400 response to the webhook caller."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "2e5705d7-e56e-4669-868c-40824ebc50f4",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
